  "wikitext": "\n{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Samosa.png|200px|left|Samosa|link=Special:FilePath/Samosa.png]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |level = 103\n |price = 1 to 223\n |time = 1 h 15 min\n |xp = 27\n |source = {{Infoicon|deepfr|bigger|link=Deep Fryer}}\n |base = 62\n |dia = 4\n |time3 = 1 h 3 min\n |title = [[Products|Product]]}}\n\n'''Samosa''' are a [[Products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 103.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making samosa'''===\n[[File:Deep_Fryer.png|150px|left|Deep Fryer]]\nSamosa are made in the [[Deep Fryer]].\n\nTo make samosa, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Chickpea.png|75px|Chickpea|link=Chickpea]]\n|[[File:Wheat.png|75px|Wheat|link=Wheat]]\n|[[File:Potato.png|75px|Potato|link=Potato]]\n|[[File:Chili Pepper.png|75px|Chili Pepper|link=Chili Pepper]]\n|-\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x4'''\n|'''x3'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour and 15 minutes to make one serving, and 1 hour and 3 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] machine. Each serving gives players 27 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling samosa'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Samosa can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,232 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 servings.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make samosa costs 192 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 2 servings of samosa per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Samosa\n|es = Samosa\n|fr = Samosa\n|it = Samosa\n|nl = Samosa\n|no = Samosa\n|ru = Самоса\n|zh = Samosa\n}}\n[[pt-br:Chamuça]]\n\n[[Category:Deep Fryer Products]]\n[[Category:Chickpea Products]]\n[[Category:Wheat Products]]\n[[Category:Potato Products]]\n[[Category:Chili Pepper Products]]",
